          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "One-time fee for a fully-vetted, permanent, and globally compliant team member."
          },
          {
            "tag": "h3",
            "text": "Solutions Built for Scale"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Expert teams solving your toughest growth challenges."
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "SEO Grow your organic traffic, increase conversions, and improve search rankings with data-driven SEO."
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Data Annotation Accelerate AI projects with precise, human-annotated data, delivering 98%+ accuracy for model training."
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Game Dev Ship Unity and mobile game MVPs fast, with expert support that scales as your studio grows."
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Fintech Dev Build secure, compliant fintech products with devs skilled in payments, trading, and industry regulations"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "AI Dev Prototype, train, and deploy models with ML engineers who deliver production-ready AI."
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "SaaS Dev Launch and scale your platform with engineering pods that build reliable, user-friendly SaaS products."
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Cybersecurity Protect your product with security experts who design, test, and implement robust defenses."
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Solve your toughest business challenges with the right talent. Latest Articles Browse all articles For Employers Why Senior Developers Quit Software Companies: Pay, Culture &amp; Leadership Senior developers don’t quit suddenly—they disengage first. This guide breaks down the real reasons top engineers leave software companies, from pay and poor management to burnout and dying codebases. More importantly, it shows what these exits reveal about leadership, culture, and how to retain your best talent."
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "AI agents deliver autonomous task execution with measurable returns: 88% of enterprises report positive ROI, some achieving 4.3x within 12 months. These systems handle customer support, IT operations, and data management independently, cutting costs by 40% while boosting revenue 6-10%. Adoption has exploded, making agentic AI core business infrastructure."
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Enterprise AI adoption has hit 78% globally in 2026, up from 55% just years ago. This surge signals AI&#x27;s shift from experimentation to mission-critical operations. Companies face talent gaps and ROI concerns, but competitive pressure and mature infrastructure are driving rapid, enterprise-wide AI integration."
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Open-source AI released five frontier-class models under permissive licenses in 2025, proving reasoning doesn&#x27;t need proprietary walls. On-premises solutions now control over half the LLM market, forcing closed vendors to compete on price, speed, and openness—or lose."
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "The best tech leaders aren&#x27;t just great at building software. They&#x27;re exceptional at leading people, thinking strategically, and scaling teams without breaking them. These 15 books give you the frameworks, insights, and practical tools to level up from good engineering leader to exceptional one."
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Enterprise LLM adoption is exploding—from under 5% in 2023 to over 80% by 2026—but execution is failing. While 72% of enterprises plan bigger budgets and the market races toward $71 billion, only 13% see enterprise-wide impact. The numbers reveal a massive gap between adoption enthusiasm and actual operational success."
          },
